<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to {{appName}}</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; }
        .content { background: white; padding: 40px 20px; border: 1px solid #e1e1e1; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background: #667eea; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to {{appName}}!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Hi {{firstName}},</h2>
        <p>Welcome to the most comprehensive crypto portfolio tracking platform! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
        
        <h3>Get Started:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Connect your exchange accounts</li>
            <li>Import your existing portfolio</li>
            <li>Set up price alerts</li>
            <li>Track your performance</li>
        </ul>
        
        {{#if verificationRequired}}
        <p><strong>Please verify your email address to activate your account:</strong></p>
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">Or copy this link: {{verificationUrl}}</p>
        {{/if}}
        
        <p>If you have any questions, our support team is here to help at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
        
        <p>Happy trading!</p>
        <p>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Unsubscribe</a> | <a href="{{appUrl}}/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>